WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.300
A customer visits once.

2
00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:02.660
What brings them back?

3
00:00:03.140 --> 00:00:05.460
With Muwalif, you follow up on WhatsApp,

4
00:00:05.780 --> 00:00:07.060
at the right time, with their permission.

5
00:00:07.380 --> 00:00:10.020
They scan the code and choose
which messages they receive.

6
00:00:10.460 --> 00:00:13.460
You record their visit,
and their loyalty card starts.

7
00:00:14.765 --> 00:00:17.176
After the visit, we ask how it went.

8
00:00:17.576 --> 00:00:19.736
Have feedback? It reaches you privately.

9
00:00:20.136 --> 00:00:21.736
They also get a Google review link,

10
00:00:22.056 --> 00:00:23.096
whatever their opinion.

11
00:00:23.496 --> 00:00:24.456
Haven't seen them in a while?

12
00:00:24.816 --> 00:00:26.936
We remind them when it suits your business.

13
00:00:27.336 --> 00:00:28.776
A barbershop differs from a car wash,

14
00:00:29.096 --> 00:00:30.136
and a salon has its own timing.

15
00:00:30.576 --> 00:00:31.976
Each month, you review the campaign

16
00:00:32.056 --> 00:00:33.816
and approve it before it goes out.

17
00:00:34.176 --> 00:00:35.816
Want Arabic content and design?

18
00:00:36.216 --> 00:00:37.576
We can add that for you.

19
00:00:38.136 --> 00:00:39.976
They return, book, or say stop?

20
00:00:40.256 --> 00:00:41.096
The reminders stop.

21
00:00:41.456 --> 00:00:43.336
You set the messaging budget.

22
00:00:43.696 --> 00:00:44.856
And with a weekly report,

23
00:00:45.096 --> 00:00:47.656
you see confirmed visits
and message costs.

24
00:00:48.056 --> 00:00:50.216
A code scan alone doesn't count as a visit.

25
00:00:50.496 --> 00:00:53.096
The WhatsApp number and business account
are in your shop's name.

26
00:00:53.443 --> 00:00:55.336
Muwalif. For the next visit.
